# Estonian counting-toward-the-hour clock: "veerand <H>" == a quarter of the
# way toward hour H, i.e. (H-1):15 -- "veerand uheksa" == 08:15.  Citation:
# Erelt, Mati (ed.) "Estonian Language", Linguistica Uralica Suppl. Series 1,
# Estonian Academy Publishers 2003, time-expression sec.; EKI Eesti Keele
# Instituut "Sonaveeb" entry "veerand", clock sense.
veerand
